### Свободные слоты
GET https://localhost:7227/api/slots/free

### Записаться
POST https://localhost:7227/api/slots/book
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "time": "10:45:00",
  "studentName": "Егор",
  "group": "348Кп",
  "studentId": 5
}

### Все записи
GET https://localhost:7227/api/slots/bookings

### Отменить запись студента 5
DELETE https://localhost:7227/api/slots/book/5
### Регистрация
POST https://localhost:7227/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "12345",
  "password": "qwerty",
  "fullName": "Егор Тестов",
  "group": "348Кп"
}

### Вход
POST https://localhost:7227/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "12345",
  "password": "qwerty"
}